sequenceDiagram
    actor D as Dispatcher
    participant W as Sean AI (web)
    participant E as Decision engine
    participant B as Broker
    participant T as Telegram bot
    actor R as Driver
    D->>W: Search loads (Dallas, TX, DH-O 100)
    W->>E: Score each result (rate, trip + deadhead, HOS)
    E-->>W: Accept / Negotiate / Reject
    W-->>D: Results table with Smart pick
    D->>W: Open load, Call Assistant
    W-->>D: Script, target rate, walk-away rate
    D->>B: Phone call / email
    B-->>D: Agreed rate
    D->>W: Book load ($ agreed)
    W->>W: Create Load, mark posting booked
    D->>W: Assign driver + truck
    W->>T: Notify driver
    T->>R: New load details + button
    R->>T: Picked up → Delivered, POD photo
    T->>W: Update status, save POD
    W-->>D: Status board and dashboard updated
